[en.FOCUS_C18_101_CLIMATE_RESEARCH]
Emergency Cold Protection Research I

[en.FOCUS_C18_101_CLIMATE_RESEARCH_desc]
To deal with the threat of the Windigos, we can urgently mobilize the national scientific research force to study technologies to resist the cold. For example, steam hubs, heaters, hothouse, etc.

[en.FOCUS_C18_101_CLIMATE_RESEARCH_TOOLTIP]
§CWait... When did we start the research? And who completed the research?§!\n§CIf recalled correctly, the conclusion of the climate risk assessment at that time seems to be that the climate risk is not urgent?§!\n§RNot sure, check the report again.§!

[zh.FOCUS_C18_101_CLIMATE_RESEARCH]
紧急御寒研究 I

[zh.FOCUS_C18_101_CLIMATE_RESEARCH_desc]
为应对风之魔的威胁，我们可以紧急动用全国的科研力量，研究抵御寒冷的科技。例如蒸汽枢纽、加热器、温室等。

[zh.FOCUS_C18_101_CLIMATE_RESEARCH_TOOLTIP]
§C等等... 我们什么时候启动的研究？又是谁完成的研究？§!\n§C还记得当时的气候风险评估结论似乎是气候风险并不紧急？而且应该需要很长时间才能研究成功？§!\n§R不确定，再看看报告。§!

